---
import ContactModal from "./ui/ContactModal.astro";
---

<footer
  class="bg-[#E75DEE] flex flex-col lg:flex-row m-4 sm:m-8 md:m-12 lg:m-16 xl:m-22 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl lg:rounded-4xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 lg:p-12 justify-between gap-8 lg:gap-0"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col pr-0 lg:pr-12 xl:pr-36 space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 md:space-y-5">
    <h1
      class="font-anton text-white text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-8xl pr-0 lg:pr-16 xl:pr-30 leading-none text-center lg:text-left"
    >
      ¿Tienes una idea o proyecto en mente?
    </h1>
    <span
      class="font-light text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-white pr-0 lg:pr-12 xl:pr-36 text-center lg:text-left"
      >Hablemos y demos vida a algo increíble juntos. Estoy listo para ayudarte a destacar en el
      mundo digital</span
    >
    <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
      <button
        id="open-contact-btn"
        class="font-extrabold text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl bg-[#1E1B1B] text-white w-40 sm:w-44 md:w-50 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-opacity-80 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
        >Contáctame</button
      >
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:justify-end items-center lg:items-end">
    <div class="flex flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:gap-6">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/xavierdev25"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-[#1E1B1B] w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 lg:w-24 lg:h-24 p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 lg:p-6 rounded-full"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" fill="none"
          ><path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            clip-rule="evenodd"
            d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8C0 11.54 2.29 14.53 5.47 15.59C5.87 15.66 6.02 15.42 6.02 15.21C6.02 15.02 6.01 14.39 6.01 13.72C4 14.09 3.48 13.23 3.32 12.78C3.23 12.55 2.84 11.84 2.5 11.65C2.22 11.5 1.82 11.13 2.49 11.12C3.12 11.11 3.57 11.7 3.72 11.94C4.44 13.15 5.59 12.81 6.05 12.6C6.12 12.08 6.33 11.73 6.56 11.53C4.78 11.33 2.92 10.64 2.92 7.58C2.92 6.71 3.23 5.99 3.74 5.43C3.66 5.23 3.38 4.41 3.82 3.31C3.82 3.31 4.49 3.1 6.02 4.13C6.66 3.95 7.34 3.86 8.02 3.86C8.7 3.86 9.38 3.95 10.02 4.13C11.55 3.09 12.22 3.31 12.22 3.31C12.66 4.41 12.38 5.23 12.3 5.43C12.81 5.99 13.12 6.7 13.12 7.58C13.12 10.65 11.25 11.33 9.47 11.53C9.76 11.78 10.01 12.26 10.01 13.01C10.01 14.08 10 14.94 10 15.21C10 15.42 10.15 15.67 10.55 15.59C13.71 14.53 16 11.53 16 8C16 3.58 12.42 0 8 0Z"
            transform="scale(64)"
            fill="#ffff"></path></svg
        >
      </a>
      <a
        class="bg-[#1E1B1B] w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 lg:w-24 lg:h-24 p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 lg:p-6 rounded-full"
        href="https://www.instagram.com/xvir25/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
